            "review_title": "Review at Cafe 1600 - The Cloud Hunting Cafe",
            "review_text": "Charlotte240401\nAmble, United Kingdom2 contributions\n0\nStunning views for a morning coffee\nAug 2026 • Couples\nAfter initially going the wrong way thanks to google maps, we came to this wonderful cafe overlooking the valley. 250k per person which included a drink, pastry and a golf cart up the hill but worth every penny. Drinks reasonable once up there. Very tasty drinks. Excellent views. Definitely not one to miss (unless it’s raining!!)\nWritten August 14, 2026",
