            "review_text": "Peter\n264 contributions\n0\nNice top view\nNov 2025 • Friends\nA nice cool area to savour fruit juices as well as coffee with eggs. It goes well with croissant. Needs to go up by buggy rides at the common parking area near Ville De Mont. \nA nice view if the neighboring places. A nice place to take pics with the setting of the sun over the mountain ranges in the background.\nWritten November 28, 2025",
